# Errors of the read-only data API under /data/v1 (docs/data.md), in the `error` field of {"code","error"}.
data-error-param = The parameter "{ $name }" is not valid.
data-error-not-found = No such data source, or nothing you can read here.
data-error-unauthorized = Sign in to read your own data.
data-error-method = The data API only answers GET requests.
data-error-cross-site = The data API only answers requests from this site's own pages.
data-error-unavailable = The site is busy; try again in a few seconds.
data-error-internal = The data could not be read; the error was logged.
